    TOO_LONG_ID


Grammar

    0 $accept: any_program $end

    1 any_program: ε
    2            | program

    3 program: program_elem
    4        | program program_elem

    5 program_elem: var_declaration
    6             | function_definition

    7 function_definition_start: function_definition_prelude func_params C_PAR O_CURLY_BRACKET

    8 function_definition_prelude: ID O_PAR

    9 function_definition: function_definition_start statement_list C_CURLY_BRACKET

   10 func_params: ε
   11            | some_params

   12 some_params: variable
   13            | some_params COMMA variable

   14 variable: LONG_ID
   15         | ID

   16 var_list: variable
   17         | var_list COMMA variable

   18 var_declaration: AUTO var_list

   19 expression: function_call
   20           | variable
   21           | NB
   22           | expression PLUS expression
   23           | expression MINUS expression
   24           | variable ASSIGN expression
   25           | expression ASTE expression
   26           | expression PERCENT expression
   27           | expression SLASH expression
   28           | expression comp_operation expression

   29 comp_operation: EQUAL
   30               | NOT_EQUAL
   31               | SUP
   32               | S_SUP
   33               | INF
   34               | S_INF

   35 expression_list: expression
   36                | expression_list COMMA expression

   37 function_call: ID O_PAR expression_list C_PAR
   38              | ID O_PAR C_PAR

   39 if_prelude: IF O_PAR expression C_PAR

   40 if_condition: if_prelude statement

   41 optional_else: ε
   42              | ELSE statement

   43 while_label: WHILE

   44 while_prelude: while_label O_PAR expression C_PAR

   45 condition_branching: if_condition optional_else
   46                    | while_prelude statement

   47 statement: condition_branching
   48          | O_CURLY_BRACKET statement_list C_CURLY_BRACKET
   49          | var_declaration SEMICOLON
   50          | expression SEMICOLON
   51          | RETURN expression SEMICOLON
   52          | SEMICOLON

   53 statement_list: ε
   54               | statement_list statement


